   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "md-select",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 🎯 Section 6: Feature Selection\n",
    "\n",
    "We now select only our **8 key features + 1 target**. These were chosen because:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Online Boarding & Inflight Wifi** → Digital touchpoints with high correlation to satisfaction in modern travel studies\n",
    "2. **Seat Comfort & Cleanliness** → Physical experience ratings that directly affect perceived quality\n",
    "3. **Class & Type of Travel** → Segment-level context (Business class passengers expect more; business travelers are more demanding)\n",
    "4. **Flight Distance** → Longer flights expose passengers to more service opportunities (and failures)\n",
    "5. **Total Delay** → Operational metric with direct, measurable impact on mood\n",
    "\n",
    "Using fewer, meaningful features also makes the **Django UI cleaner and more user-friendly**."
   ]
